  "description": "*Meet your perfect ideal type in the game!*\n\nJi-Hyeong is trapped in the fantasy game 'EROS' developed by a friend. When Ji-Hyeong can only return to reality after seeing the ending due to a bug, the game distributor team leader Hyun-Woo enters the game to help. Ji-Hyeong feels excited seeing Hyun-Woo, who is such a perfect ideal type. There is no progress in the game due to their mysterious relationship, and to make matters worse, Ji-Hyeong meets a game character who looks exactly like Se-Jun, who hurt him deeply...\n\nWill they be able to successfully clear the game and escape?\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
